                "letterSpacing" : "normal",
                "lineHeight" : 1.5,
                "textTransform" : "none"
              },
              "text" : "<strong>Families who choose Zeta for Elementary School have a school that partners with them all the way through high school.</strong>  Along the way, children will learn within a community that knows them deeply and grows with them.<br /><br />If you would like to learn more about our Pre-K through Grade 12 journey, sign up here for <a href=\"https://zetaschools.org/events-for-prospective-families/\" target=\"_blank\" part=\"link\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">an upcoming tour</a>.<br /><br />We look forward to welcoming you soon.<br /><br /><br />Warmly,<br /><strong>The Zeta Enrollment Team</strong><br />Zeta Charter Schools<br /><br /><em>Please reach out if you have any questions about Zeta, our Enrollment Team is here for you every step of the way. ✉︎  enroll&#64;zetaschools.org &#x1f4de;(646) 480-1654</em><br /><br />"
            },
            "definition" : "lightning/paragraph",
            "id" : "18ab3856-066c-47f3-be32-7e0c1a2d60d8",
